sushi-ds41 vendors a slice of sushi (MIT, Theinruj Toranavikrai and David Dalcu) in src/sushi/, in sushi's own folders
(dsv41/, glm5/, exl3/), copied by scripts/sync-sushi.sh from commit ec2f5a2909725333d14ee005e489c85d5655f1e4. The files
model.zig, transformer.zig, status.zig, scheduler.zig, test_models.zig, tokenizer.zig, dflash.zig, model_load.zig,
pair_major_pack_test.zig, dsv41/transient_peak.zig and dsv41/repack.zig there are this repo's own cut edges. It is built against the mlx-serve plugin kit.
The sync then applies this repo's edits to the copy: patches/*.patch.
